WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.139 --> 00:00:09.689
In tutorial 8.5, you'll
work through AI growth,

00:00:09.739 --> 00:00:13.826
the weekly list that helps AI
assistants find, name and cite you.

00:00:14.846 --> 00:00:18.721
First, open AI visibility
and scroll to AI growth.

00:00:18.771 --> 00:00:22.508
It's the weekly work that gets
you named and cited in AI answers.

00:00:23.538 --> 00:00:27.738
Four figures sum up the week:
pages sent to Bing and IndexNow,

00:00:27.788 --> 00:00:32.587
how ready your key pages are, pages
citing others, and AI pages written.

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:38.885
Next, One file to add helps your new and
updated pages reach search engines the same

00:00:38.935 --> 00:00:39.497
week.

00:00:40.602 --> 00:00:45.162
Copy the key, add the file at the root
of your site, then click Check the file.

00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:46.827
Show me how walks you through it.

00:00:48.585 --> 00:00:53.635
Then, Pages AI cites without naming you
lists the pages assistants rely on for your

00:00:53.685 --> 00:00:56.310
questions, and who they name instead.

00:00:57.273 --> 00:01:01.398
Each row has a next step, like
asking a list's editor to add you.

00:01:01.448 --> 00:01:03.914
Names you marks the pages that already do.

00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:08.294
Show the draft opens an
e-mail written for you.

00:01:08.344 --> 00:01:11.544
Send it from your own e-mail,
then click Mark as sent,

00:01:11.594 --> 00:01:13.429
or Not a fit if it isn't right.

00:01:14.438 --> 00:01:18.738
Now, Questions to win lists the
questions AI answers without you,

00:01:18.788 --> 00:01:22.448
each with a new answer page,
or a refresh of one of yours.

00:01:23.467 --> 00:01:28.392
Won means AI now names you there. Write
it now writes a queued page straight away,

00:01:28.442 --> 00:01:30.126
without waiting for its turn.

00:01:31.488 --> 00:01:35.678
Finally, Can AI read and quote
your key pages scores each page,

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:38.763
with its update date and
the one fix to make first.

00:01:39.757 --> 00:01:44.592
Here, the fix is to phrase your section
headings as the questions buyers ask.

00:01:46.278 --> 00:01:49.938
So each week you know which file
to add, who to ask for a mention,

00:01:49.988 --> 00:01:53.947
with the e-mail ready, which
questions to win, and what to fix.

00:01:54.966 --> 00:01:58.491
So, read the week's figures,
add the IndexNow file,

00:01:58.541 --> 00:02:03.396
see the pages that leave you out, win
questions with a page, and fix your key pages.

00:02:04.411 --> 00:02:06.761
You're working to be named. Next,

00:02:06.811 --> 00:02:10.455
see exactly what AI said
about you in tutorial 8.6.
